From d5b8ebc66ddd76c60e5d4d8e3bf8bf7b61ccce3c Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: OneFeiFan <3022504358@qq.com>
Date: Thu, 29 Oct 2026 01:52:56 +0800
Subject: [PATCH] config: enable BBRv1 and BBRv3
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

Enable TCP_CONG_ADVANCED, BBR (v1) and BBRv3 in gki_defconfig, keeping
the default congestion control at cubic.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Code <noreply@anthropic.com>

Origin: WildKernels 5.10 BBRv3 backport, original from Google bbr-v3-2024-02-22-01 (fatalcoder524)（本补丁：gki_defconfig）
Upstream-Status: Not-Applicable
KABI: none
Depends-On: previous three patches
Tested-On: yudi 5.10.272（r2 构建与开机）, 2026-10-29
---
 arch/arm64/configs/gki_defconfig | 7 +++++++
 1 file changed, 7 insertions(+)

diff --git a/arch/arm64/configs/gki_defconfig b/arch/arm64/configs/gki_defconfig
index b4ec5b51a..55c2dc89f 100644
--- a/arch/arm64/configs/gki_defconfig
+++ b/arch/arm64/configs/gki_defconfig
@@ -160,6 +160,13 @@ CONFIG_NET_IPVTI=y
 CONFIG_INET_ESP=y
 CONFIG_INET_UDP_DIAG=y
 CONFIG_INET_DIAG_DESTROY=y
+# yudi: TCP congestion control: BBRv1 and BBRv3 (default stays cubic)
+CONFIG_TCP_CONG_ADVANCED=y
+CONFIG_TCP_CONG_BBR=y
+# CONFIG_TCP_CONG_BIC is not set
+# CONFIG_TCP_CONG_WESTWOOD is not set
+# CONFIG_TCP_CONG_HTCP is not set
+CONFIG_TCP_CONG_BBR3=y
 CONFIG_IPV6_ROUTER_PREF=y
 CONFIG_IPV6_ROUTE_INFO=y
 CONFIG_IPV6_OPTIMISTIC_DAD=y
-- 
2.43.0

